{"seq":11,"slug":"mobile-security","title":"移动应用安全","stage":"DONE","category":"mobile","chapterCount":5,"docCount":16,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 移动应用安全\n\n手机已成为人们生活的中枢，存储着照片、聊天、位置、健康数据，连接着银行与支付，承载着身份与隐私。正因如此，移动应用成了攻击者垂涎的目标，移动安全也成了每一位移动开发者不可推卸的责任。一个看似微小的疏漏——明文存储的密码、未加密的通信、可被篡改的逻辑——都可能导致数据泄露、资金损失乃至隐私灾难。本知识库系统讲解移动安全的威胁、原理与防护之道。\n\n面向具备一定 iOS / Android 开发经验、希望系统建立安全与隐私意识的移动工程师，无需安全专业背景，但需要对「用户数据值得保护」有基本的认同。\n\n**基础与防御理念**阐明移动安全为何特殊、如何从攻击者视角做威胁建模、平台提供的安全基础（沙盒、权限、安全存储），以及「纵深防御、绝不单纯信任客户端」的核心理念。\n\n**数据存储安全**讲解本地存储的风险、「最小化存储」第一原则、平台安全密钥存储区的使用、加密与密钥管理，以及日志、缓存、备份等隐蔽泄露途径。\n\n**认证与生物识别**介绍令牌认证模型与安全管理、生物识别的正确使用（应用不接触生物数据）、会话管理，以及「信任锚点在服务端」等认证原则。\n\n**网络通信安全**讲解 HTTPS 这一不可妥协的底线、证书校验与中间人攻击防范、证书锁定，以及 API 通信中「服务端绝不信任客户端」的原则。\n\n**代码保护与隐私**剖析逆向威胁、代码混淆、运行环境检测与防篡改，并讲解权限的恰当使用、数据最小化、第三方供应链风险，总结移动安全守护用户信任的根本意义。\n\n建议按章节顺序阅读。第一章建立整体的威胁意识与防御理念，第二至四章分别从数据存储、认证、网络三个维度展开具体防护，第五章涵盖代码保护并上升到隐私与责任。阅读时不妨始终把握一条主线：移动应用运行在不可信的设备上，因此「绝不单纯信任客户端、关键校验由服务端兜底」，而一切安全实践，最终都服务于守护用户的信任。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础与防御理念","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-mobile-security-special","title":"移动安全为何特殊","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/foundations/why-mobile-security-special"},{"seq":2,"slug":"threat-modeling","title":"威胁建模","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/foundations/threat-modeling"},{"seq":3,"slug":"platform-basics-and-defense","title":"平台安全基础与纵深防御","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/foundations/platform-basics-and-defense"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"data-storage","title":"数据存储安全","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/data-storage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"local-storage-risks","title":"本地存储的风险与最小化原则","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/data-storage/local-storage-risks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"keystore-and-encryption","title":"安全存储区、加密与密钥管理","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/data-storage/keystore-and-encryption"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hidden-leak-channels","title":"隐蔽的泄露途径","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/data-storage/hidden-leak-channels"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"authentication","title":"认证与生物识别","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/authentication","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"token-based-auth","title":"基于令牌的认证","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/authentication/token-based-auth"},{"seq":2,"slug":"biometrics","title":"生物识别的正确使用","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/authentication/biometrics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"session-and-trust-anchor","title":"会话管理与服务端信任锚点","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/authentication/session-and-trust-anchor"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"network-security","title":"网络通信安全","docCount":3,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/network-security","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"https-baseline","title":"HTTPS 是不可妥协的底线","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/network-security/https-baseline"},{"seq":2,"slug":"mitm-and-cert-pinning","title":"中间人攻击与证书锁定","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/network-security/mitm-and-cert-pinning"},{"seq":3,"slug":"api-trust","title":"服务端绝不信任客户端","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/network-security/api-trust"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"code-and-privacy","title":"代码保护与隐私","docCount":4,"url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/code-and-privacy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reverse-engineering-and-obfuscation","title":"逆向工程与代码混淆","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/code-and-privacy/reverse-engineering-and-obfuscation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"runtime-detection-anti-tamper","title":"运行环境检测与防篡改","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/code-and-privacy/runtime-detection-anti-tamper"},{"seq":3,"slug":"privacy-and-permissions","title":"隐私、权限与数据最小化","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/code-and-privacy/privacy-and-permissions"},{"seq":4,"slug":"supply-chain-and-significance","title":"第三方供应链与移动安全的意义","url":"/h/mobile/mobile-security/code-and-privacy/supply-chain-and-significance"}]}]}